14:17:54 said  Connecting a simulator looked empty because the Mac's proxy route was off and the window wasn't refreshing while it sat idle; both are fixed. Press **Run check** on Live Capture and it now sends a real request through the proxy, shows PASS with a timing, and reports whether a simulator would inherit a working route. If it says **Direct (off)**, press **Use Mac proxy** and confirm, then reopen the app in the simulator. There is also a new **Full HTTPS catch** switch, plus a **Hook an IDE** card on Agent Control that copies a ready-to-paste brief so an AI agent can test and verify calls itself. …
